{"parse": {"title": "凡人或英雄-06", "pageid": 147020, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%87%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84-05\" title=\"凡人或英雄-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">凡人或英雄-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%87%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84-07\" title=\"凡人或英雄-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">凡人或英雄</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AC.AC.E5.8D.81.E4.B8.89.E9.A1.B9.E5.8A.9F.E7.BB.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"第十三项功绩\">第十三项功绩</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 第十三项功绩</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Thirteenth Labor</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>之后的事，你应该很清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>是的……那是一场惨烈的战争，您的同伴追随您跃下了火山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>如果您不愿意再提起……我也能理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>不。我并不害怕叙述死亡，只是……轮回让我遗忘了太多细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>但我记得战斗的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他们死去了，而我活了下来。结果就是如此简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我本可以一个人面对提丰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅将盒子合上，拿着它站起身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>感谢你赠予我这件物品，但我无法解答你的困惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你拒绝了金钱，但我可以展示一些你可能感兴趣的物品……一种，历史的兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那些老掉牙的故事，现在了解的人已经不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>我已经打扰您够久了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>跟我来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>学者只好收起了本子，跟随赫多涅走入了另一间房间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一间富丽堂皇的房间，堆叠着无数让人眼花缭乱的宝藏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其中最引人瞩目的，是一列被精心保护的各式武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>学者一时遗忘了礼节，扑到玻璃柜前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>如果我没认错，这是两千年前盾的制式……上面甚至雕刻着蛇发女妖！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315628.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315628.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>是的，这是我的藏宝室。这些是我的朋友们留下的东西。我第一世收集的藏品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315628.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315628.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我忘记了他们的长相，但他们的武器还留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走到艾尔玛身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这面盾属于克珊托斯，是他的常用武器。但他没有带着它参加提丰之战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他是我们中最年长的。我记得他长着络腮胡，闲的时候喜欢弹奏七弦琴，讲述那些史诗故事。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_22\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-3_9_at_22.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-3_9_at_22.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/Cg-3_9_at_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-561120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-561120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-561120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年老的战士：</div><div>受死吧，提丰——！呃！！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>那个呢！那个是谁的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一面玻璃窗后悬挂着一把黄铜色的长矛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那是墨提斯用过的东西。这柄枪中间曾经掰断过，我找人重新修好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>她性格内敛，话很少，我对她的记忆不多了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安静的战士：</div><div>赫多涅，接住！……啊！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅向右走了一步，看向一对华美的匕首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这对兄弟是“泼酒”游戏的高手，我记得他们中的一个笑声响亮，另一个则喜欢叹气。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_18\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-3_9_at_18.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-3_9_at_18.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-3_9_at_18.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-637220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-637220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-637220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瘦削的战士：</div><div>咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-637020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-637020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-637020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">高个子的战士：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅收回手，打开旁边空置的玻璃柜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打开盒子，拿出那把青铜剑，将它安稳地放置柜中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>欧洛斯是我的童年玩伴，我们认识很久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他很擅长那些政治事务：和人辩论，克扣支出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>锈迹斑斑的短剑沉睡在玻璃后，早已无法反射出任何人的面庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315628.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315628.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-315628.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315628.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_19_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_19_zone\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_19_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_at_19_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_19_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"468\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1e/Cg-3_9_at_19_zone.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"636\" data-file-height=\"496\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>提丰！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她怒吼着巨兽的名字，用力拉开了弓箭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>看着我！！！</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_9_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血淋淋的巨大眼球被生生剖出，丢弃一旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>恶心的怪物，该死的巨兽！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>站起来！给我站起来！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅踩在提丰的身体上。她手握羽箭，一遍遍在它的心脏中穿刺、搅动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黏稠的血肉溅到了她的身上。任谁都看得出，提丰已经彻底死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>停手吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>提丰已经死了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山口外，原本浓厚的乌云已然彻底消散，悬崖只剩下海浪拍击的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……我们从另一边下山。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>他们是最优秀的勇士，值得凯迈昂人最高的尊重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我不想在匆忙中碰到他们的尸体。等我们乘船回来，我会为他们举行最隆重的火葬仪式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>……他们原本都活着。如果不是你下令——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我没有下令。不要低估他们的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>呵……勇气？你为什么总是如此……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐约的怨气让赫多涅皱起了眉头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>如果你还有别的话，那就直说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>欧洛斯闭了闭眼，但最终只是转身向着山下走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>没有。至少我们杀死了提丰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>一切的牺牲都是有意义的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>意义……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从山口远眺，半圆形的外围岛屿覆着美丽的翠绿色，几只海鸥从他们的头顶飞过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>第二故乡……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比赛的裁判正在海岸边等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>欢迎凯旋！赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>你们拿回了提丰的眼睛，我们的交易完成了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>按照规则，我将把火山的力量赐予胜者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>赫多涅，提丰的眼睛由你挖出——你将会是新的火山之主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……但我的朋友们死了，我们失去了许多优秀的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这也在你的意料之中吗，火山？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>提丰是神话中的巨兽。我早就说过，挑战它有可能付出生命的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但你不惧危险，勇猛战斗……为了追求乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我很欣赏这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>精疲力竭的选手并未立刻接下奖牌与荣誉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……我没有得到任何乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我心里剩下的唯有愤怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山颇为疑惑地偏了偏头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>或许是因为这次比赛准备得太过匆忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我相信，下一次比赛，你会发挥得更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅敏锐地注意到了那个词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>下一次？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>下一次的提丰之战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>这不是唯一的比赛，提丰与火山岛紧密相连，它还会复活的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅向前几步，一把扼住火山的咽喉，将她提到空中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你骗我？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我没有欺骗你。杀死提丰的人，将获得火山的力量。这条比赛规则，下一次也不会改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但提丰再度复苏，可能要千年之后……与之相比，你们的寿命太过短暂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但不用担心，火山的力量中包含着轮回者的祝福。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-655203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>千年后，你会作为战士再度复活！为你的族人奋战，再次享受搏杀的乐趣！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这番荒谬的结论让赫多涅再次大笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>乐趣？你享受的根本不是正面搏杀的快感，而是在安全的地方作壁上观！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你和那些罗马老爷们没有区别——我们对你来说不过是一场令人兴奋的角斗节目！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那我死去的朋友们……我们的努力又算什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅加大了手上的力度，女孩的嘴唇浮现出窒息的青紫色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-655204.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655204.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655204.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-655204.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-655204.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>咳……虽然我并不明白你为何如此愤怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-655204.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655204.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655204.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-655204.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-655204.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但你无法杀死一个幻影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她冷冷地瞥了两眼火山，随后松开了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我拒绝接受你的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>……拒绝？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅将提丰之眼丢在火山脚下，头也不回地向着海面走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>你如果不接受，他们就白死了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>既然付出了如此多的代价，终于打倒了提丰。那就应该接受这份力量！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-656701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>然后回到族中，你会成为——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我不会让任何人，或是神明侮辱我朋友的牺牲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>你会失去一份强大的力量。你们正是因为力量不足，才会背井离乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>这里还有你们想要的第二故乡——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我们是凯迈昂人，我们不会成为别人游戏中的玩物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我不会让我的族人们变成这场千年游戏中的筹码！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>至于力量——即使我不接受你的力量，我也会是全希腊最强大的英雄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将两根手指放入口中，吹出一阵短促的哨声。刻托的脊背在海面上浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忽然，她听到了耳后破空的风声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-315611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-315611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-315611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在她转头之前，一支羽箭没入了她的左肩。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "凡人或英雄-06"}}